# Recovery Playbook — {{PROJECT_NAME}}

_Documented incidents and their fixes. Read BEFORE proposing a fix for any
failure — the pattern may already be here._

## How to use this document

When something breaks:
1. Check if the symptom matches a pattern below
2. If yes: follow the documented fix, don't re-derive
3. If no: fix it, then add the pattern here in the same commit

## Incident template

Copy this for each new incident:

```markdown
### [Date] Short description

**Symptom:** What the operator/agent sees (error message, health check failure)
**Root cause:** Why it happened
**Fix:** What was done (with commands if applicable)
**Verification:** How to confirm the fix worked
**Prevention:** What changed to prevent recurrence (test=, check=, etc.)
**Commit:** Link to the fix commit
```

